{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}About{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="main white container">

        {% include 'alerts.html.twig' %}
        <h1>{{ block('title') }}</h1>

        <p>Red Book is run by the <a href="https://lotrtcgpc.net/">Players Council</a> for the Lord of the Rings
            Trading Card Game community. Card data comes from the <a href="https://wiki.lotrtcgpc.net/">PC wiki</a>
            and <a href="https://play.lotrtcgpc.net/">Gemp</a>, which also checks every deck.</p>
        <p>Card text and images are shown for reference by the fan community. The Lord of the Rings Trading Card
            Game was published by Decipher, Inc.; Red Book is not produced, endorsed or supported by Decipher,
            Middle-earth Enterprises or New Line Cinema.</p>
        <p>Built on <a href="https://github.com/ThronesDB/thronesdb">ThronesDB</a> by Alsciende and the ThronesDB
            maintainers. Bug reports and feature requests: <a href="https://github.com/PlayersCouncil/redbook/issues">GitHub</a>.</p>
        <p>This website is optimized for mobile browsing (WebKit).</p>

        <h3>Credits</h3>

        <p>I would like to thank especially:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>SP for providing the domain name</li>
            <li>The Crazy Bear-Riders for testing before release, especially mplain and alexmonk</li>
            <li><a href="http://agotgame.com/en">agotgame</a> for the idea of the color-coded type icons</li>
        </ul>

    </div>
{% endblock %}
